


main.py : to download the model from hugging face
details.py : to show the complete details of the model
bin2hex.py : to convert weights from binary to hex format


visualize : https://bbycroft.net/llm


transformer code

Every function maps one-to-one to an RTL block. The structure is intentional:

hw_embedding_lookup → BRAM address decoder
hw_elementwise_add → Residual Add unit
hw_layernorm → LayerNorm unit (two-pass, stats then normalize)
hw_vpu_bias → VPU bias add
hw_mac_matmul → MAC array + VPU bias
hw_split_qkv → address generation only, no compute unit needed
hw_attention_scores → MAC array + VPU scale
hw_causal_mask → VPU add with mask BRAM
hw_softmax → Softmax unit
hw_attention_output → MAC array
hw_gelu → VPU GELU LUT
